  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Theo định lý côsin, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì ngôi sao được tạo thành bởi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> tam giác bằng nhau nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>360</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Áp dụng định lý côsin cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>78</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm khi làm tròn tới hàng phần chục.</li><li>Diện tích của hình tròn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>6021</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cm<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>). <br>Diện tích tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>36</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>257</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cm<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>). <br>Suy ra diện tích ngôi sao là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2574</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cm<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup><mo 